# Verification (required every change)

Before considering work done, **always** run (venv or Docker — see
[CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md)):

1. `ruff check src tests`
2. `ruff format --check src tests`
3. `mypy src`
4. `pytest` with coverage ≥95% (`--cov=cicerone --cov-fail-under=95`)

Do not skip these because the change “looks small.” Fix failures before
pushing / updating the PR. Prefer Docker CI image when that is the project
norm; local `.venv` is acceptable in Cloud VMs that already have it.
